  "notes": "# Tezbar 0.3.0-beta.15\n\nColor Picker 1.0.1: the Color Wheel no longer traps you. Esc and Back close the Color Wheel command, and a wheel opened from a result goes back to that result. The Store and your installed extensions list offer the update to Color Picker 1.0.0: it appears shortly after launch, or right away when you press Refresh in the Store.\n\nExtensions: Esc and Back now leave any extension whose own Back answers with the same screen, with no screen, or with an error, instead of keeping you there.\n\nNotes: when the launcher is shown again, a note returns in the mode you left it. A rendered note keeps the search field active; a note you were editing keeps the editor active.\n\nThe beta.14 Notes Markdown, Clipboard History \"Save to Notes\", extension update checks and Color Picker wheel changes carry forward unchanged.\n",
